+
+Run inside the original assigned packet after building a return. The tool requires
+`git`, validates the archive with the repository's validator, applies the patch
+only to a fresh temporary baseline, and compares every resulting file with the
+reviewed source. It also checks compressed evidence hashes without executing
+programs from the return. Exit 0 means the actual patch applies and matches, not
+merely that ZIP member names look valid. It detected the packet builder's
+unterminated-line diff bug during this review.
